proper-kung-fu-info-claw-series-name = Claw Series
proper-kung-fu-info-claw-series-desc = Three hits in a row: +10 Blunt, 2 s stun, the target slides back 3 tiles.
proper-kung-fu-info-wolf-grip-name = Wolf Grip
proper-kung-fu-info-wolf-grip-desc = Hit, shove, grab: 15 Slash, the target can't breathe for 10 s and is held in front of you in a hard grab.
proper-kung-fu-info-perfect-flow-name = Perfect Flow
proper-kung-fu-info-perfect-flow-desc = 10 Blunt to each arm and the torso, 5 s of disorientation; from 50 damage the arm bones break.

proper-kung-fu-info-wolf-dance-name = Wolf Dance (20 s)
proper-kung-fu-info-wolf-dance-desc = Dash through a target up to 5 tiles away: 20 Blunt to the body, the target is tossed up and knocked down for 2 s. You stay on your feet.
proper-kung-fu-info-claw-whirlwind-name = Claw Whirlwind (30 s)
proper-kung-fu-info-claw-whirlwind-desc = Throw over yourself and a knee to the jaw: 10 Blunt, broken skull, brain trauma, about 2 s without moving.
proper-kung-fu-info-hammer-name = Hammer (20 s)
proper-kung-fu-info-hammer-desc = A claw strike to the head: 15 Blunt, eyes and brain -30%, the target is down for 5 s. On a lying target: 50 Blunt and 30 s of sleep.
proper-kung-fu-info-wolf-instinct-name = Wolf Instinct (30 s)
proper-kung-fu-info-wolf-instinct-desc = 3 s counter stance: parries melee (25 Slash and 75 stamina back), dashes at shooters, reflects thrown items.
proper-kung-fu-info-wolf-pack-name = Wolf Pack (80 s)
proper-kung-fu-info-wolf-pack-desc = 1-3 wolf doubles for 30 s: 20 health, half damage, they attack your enemies and never you.
proper-kung-fu-info-kunai-name = Kunai (10 s)
proper-kung-fu-info-kunai-desc = A kunai in your hand (15 Slash). Thrown, it sticks into what it hits and you appear next to it in a puff of smoke.
proper-kung-fu-info-join-pack-name = Join the Pack (60 s)
proper-kung-fu-info-join-pack-desc = Teach a person next to you for 10 seconds (moving or damage interrupts): they become a pupil of Proper Kung Fu.

proper-kung-fu-info-passive-speed-name = Speed
proper-kung-fu-info-passive-speed-desc = Fist attacks 1.5 times faster, sprint 15% faster, +10 stamina.
proper-kung-fu-info-passive-gunshot-name = Bullet toughness
proper-kung-fu-info-passive-gunshot-desc = Gunshot damage is reduced by 40%.
proper-kung-fu-info-passive-bleed-name = Blood
proper-kung-fu-info-passive-bleed-desc = Your own bleeding is halved, the wounds you inflict bleed 1.5 times more.
proper-kung-fu-info-passive-no-guns-name = No guns
proper-kung-fu-info-passive-no-guns-desc = You can't fire guns (the kunai is allowed).
proper-kung-fu-info-passive-heal-name = Enemy's blood
proper-kung-fu-info-passive-heal-desc = Every finisher heals you for 25. No finishers on the dead.

proper-kung-fu-info-synergy-series-dance-name = Claw Series → Wolf Dance
proper-kung-fu-info-synergy-series-dance-desc = Within 2 s: 30 Blunt, the target flies 5 tiles and falls.
proper-kung-fu-info-synergy-whirlwind-dance-name = Claw Whirlwind → Wolf Dance
proper-kung-fu-info-synergy-whirlwind-dance-desc = Within 2 s: a faster dash, 15 Blunt and 15 Slash, 5 tile knockback.
proper-kung-fu-info-synergy-grip-whirlwind-name = Wolf Grip → Claw Whirlwind
proper-kung-fu-info-synergy-grip-whirlwind-desc = A cross strike: 20 Blunt and 10 Slash, broken chest, no breathing for 60 s, 8 tile knockback.
proper-kung-fu-info-synergy-grip-hammer-name = Wolf Grip → Hammer → Wolf Dance
proper-kung-fu-info-synergy-grip-hammer-desc = An uppercut: 20 Blunt to the head and you backflip; for 2 s the dance is then an instant dash into the target.
proper-kung-fu-info-synergy-dance-hammer-name = Wolf Dance → Hammer
proper-kung-fu-info-synergy-dance-hammer-desc = Within 2 s after the dance: 20 Blunt to the body, the target flies exactly 5 tiles.

proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-claw-series-name = Claw Series
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-claw-series-desc = A double pushes the target back to you: 10 claw strikes and a 100 Slash cross that cuts off an arm and a leg.
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-wolf-grip-name = Wolf Grip
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-wolf-grip-desc = A bridge suplex head first into the floor: 25 Blunt to the head, 50 to the torso, broken skull.
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-perfect-flow-name = Perfect Flow
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-perfect-flow-desc = You appear behind the target and spin-kick its head for 20 Blunt.
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-wolf-dance-name = Wolf Dance
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-wolf-dance-desc = 10 dashes through the locked target and a final strike for 30 Slash to every body part.
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-claw-whirlwind-name = Claw Whirlwind
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-claw-whirlwind-desc = An ascending and a descending claw slash for 90 Slash each, the target slammed into the floor.
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-hammer-name = Hammer
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-hammer-desc = A string of strikes with a flip and a spinning strike to the head for 50 Blunt, the target flies 5 tiles.
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-wolf-instinct-name = Wolf Instinct
proper-kung-fu-info-finisher-wolf-instinct-desc = The attacker is at your mercy: 6 claw strikes and a 100 Slash cross, 10 tile knockback.

proper-kung-fu-info-pupil-claw-series-name = Claw Series
proper-kung-fu-info-pupil-claw-series-desc = Three hits in a row: +10 Blunt, 1 s stun, the target slides back 1.5 tiles.
proper-kung-fu-info-pupil-wolf-grip-name = Wolf Grip
proper-kung-fu-info-pupil-wolf-grip-desc = Hit, shove, grab: 15 Slash, the target can't breathe for 5 s and is held in a grab.
proper-kung-fu-info-pupil-perfect-flow-name = Perfect Flow
proper-kung-fu-info-pupil-perfect-flow-desc = Only 10 Blunt to the torso: no arm hits, no disorientation, no fractures.
proper-kung-fu-info-pupil-limits-name = The pupil's way
proper-kung-fu-info-pupil-limits-desc = A pupil has no skills, synergies, finishers, healing or ultimate, and none of the master's passives: no faster hits, no stamina or sprint bonus, no gunshot reduction, no bleed modifiers, no CQC bypass. A pupil can use guns normally. The style can't be passed on.
